{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921420/extras/45666947517d6eed0a22bb3cfd377df6.poster.avif?t=1765128329\" width=788 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921420/extras/45666947517d6eed0a22bb3cfd377df6.webm?t=1765128329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921420/extras/45666947517d6eed0a22bb3cfd377df6.mp4?t=1765128329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have two things, <strong>debt</strong> and a <strong>number key pad</strong>. Use the number keys on your keyboard to pay your debt in this capitalistic clicker debt paying simulator. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921420/extras/29425829ab94a150e05f177fdece358d.poster.avif?t=1765128329\" width=676 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921420/extras/29425829ab94a150e05f177fdece358d.webm?t=1765128329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921420/extras/29425829ab94a150e05f177fdece358d.mp4?t=1765128329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >use the number keypad (not required, but\u00a0preferred)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a micro game experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >speed running/typing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragrap